  "description": "With a modern take on the classic Dutch city bike, the C8i Disc LTD delivers comfort and style for wherever your day takes you.\nThe Shimano Alfine 8-speed internal hub ensures a smooth, nearly silent ride with minimal maintenance, while the Rapidfire trigger shifter provides quick, seamless gear changes. This premium model also includes thoughtful commuter-focused features: all-weather hydraulic disc brakes for controlled stopping power, weatherproof bolt-on grips, and our Premium Comfort Saddle—designed to offer the feel of a well-worn leather saddle right from your first ride.\nBuilt around a lightweight chromoly frame with a low-entry design, the C8i Disc LTD makes mounting and dismounting effortless. The chain guard and alloy fenders keep you clean and dry in all conditions, while puncture-resistant tires and strong double-walled alloy rims deliver a smooth ride across even the roughest streets.\nWith its striking design and practical features, the C8i Disc LTD stands apart from other bikes on the road. We think once you see it in person, you’ll agree.",
